{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>特斯拉CEO埃隆·馬斯克周四在社交平台X上發帖稱：「中國對石油的依賴正迅速下降」。馬斯克是在回應Ember 高級能源與氣候數據分析師尼古拉斯·富爾格姆（Nicolas Fulghum）本周早些時候的一條帖子，後者表示，今年9月，中國燃油車（ICE）的銷量佔比首次降至僅三分之一。</p>\n<p>純電動汽車的市場份額已接近半數（47.3%），插電式混合動力汽車則貢獻了另外19.7%的份額。短短5年間，燃油車的市佔率已從90%以上降至33%。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/276/w550h526/20261016/8cab-c6e540b38de92ffb23fcc5b585adfaa7.png\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/276/w550h526/20261016/8cab-c6e540b38de92ffb23fcc5b585adfaa7.png\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:59:24.221856+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:37:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:18:06.859500+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:57:43.105394+00:00","content_hash":"3c726bce5f9cc1d3a2ed3f7efe88ba089aa8c6eddea9a3ec03b26915b161056f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}